<h2>1. Executive Summary</h2>
<p>At <strong>Aimad Ul Islam's Cybersecurity Portfolio and Knowledge Platform</strong> (accessible at <code>aimadulislam.dpdns.org</code>), your privacy is fundamental. As a cybersecurity practitioner, I adhere to strict principles of privacy-by-design, data minimization, and transparent telemetry.</p>

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We operate under a strict minimal collection framework. When visiting this platform, the following data may be processed:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Server Log Telemetry:</strong> Standard web server connection parameters including client IP address (anonymized/hashed for security defense), HTTP user-agent header, requested URL, and access timestamp.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact Form Data:</strong> When submitting an inquiry via our contact terminal or email link, we process your provided name, email address, and message payload strictly to process your request.</li>
    <li><strong>Client Preference State:</strong> Local storage items used exclusively for UI theme preferences (Dark Mode / Light Mode toggle).</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Zero Intrusive Tracking</h2>
<p>This platform does <strong>NOT</strong> employ cross-site tracking cookies, behavioral advertising networks, fingerprinting scripts, or monetized user profiling tools. We believe technical education and security research must remain free of invasive surveillance.</p>

<h2>4. Use of Information</h2>
<p>Any collected telemetry is processed strictly for the following legitimate purposes:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Maintaining network defense, threat detection, and prevention against DDoS attacks or automated brute-force attempts.</li>
    <li>Ensuring high performance, content delivery efficiency, and uptime monitoring across Cloudflare CDN nodes.</li>
    <li>Responding directly to genuine technical inquiries, security consulting requests, or vulnerability reports.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Data Third-Party Processors</h2>
<p>Our infrastructure relies on trusted enterprise cloud infrastructure providers operating under strict confidentiality and compliance mandates:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>GitHub Pages / Cloudflare CDN:</strong> For static file delivery, edge caching, and SSL/TLS certificate termination.</li>
    <li><strong>Decap CMS:</strong> For content workflow authorization without storing personal telemetry.</li>
</ul>

<h2>6. Your Data Rights</h2>
<p>Under applicable international privacy standards (including GDPR and regional data rights frameworks), you possess rights to inspect, rectify, or request deletion of any personal data submitted directly through our contact forms. To exercise these rights, contact our security officer at <code>info@aimadulislam.dpdns.org</code>.</p>
